        "deckId": "deck-mtikiajd-ez0o1i",
        "content": "At sea, a {{colony /ˈkɒləni/ 一群}} of seals surrounded a {{seal}}, while a {{whale}} corrected a {{sperm whale /spɜːm weɪl/ 抹香鲸}}. A {{beast /biːst/ 走兽}} complained that a {{beast of prey /biːst əv preɪ/ 猛兽}} had stolen its ticket.",
