        "deckId": "deck-mtikiajd-ez0o1i",
        "content": "A {{herbivorous /hɜːˈbɪvərəs/ 食草的}} pony tried to {{graze /ɡreɪz/ 吃草}}, a {{carnivore /ˈkɑːnɪvɔː/ 食肉动物}} ordered a {{carnivorous}} lunch, and an {{omnivorous /ɒmˈnɪvərəs/ 杂食的}} {{primate}} ate both {{menu /ˈmenjuː/ 菜单}}. A {{rodent /ˈrəʊdnt/ 啮齿动物}} met a {{scavenger /ˈskævɪndʒə/ 食腐动物}}; a {{predator /ˈpredətə/ 捕食动物}} with {{predatory /ˈpredətri/ 捕食性的}} manners called its prey its {{quarry /ˈkwɒri/ 捕猎目标}}. Nobody was {{permitted}} to {{overgraze /ˌəʊvəˈɡreɪz/ 过度放牧}} the {{carpet}}.",
