        "id": "card-mtikiajd-rbywg1",
        "deckId": "deck-mtikiajd-ez0o1i",
        "content": "During the {{interval /ˈɪntəvl/ 幕间休息}}, an {{interval timer /ˈɪntəvl ˈtaɪmə/ 间隔计时器}} ordered a {{mime}} to impersonate the director in a {{pantomimic /ˌpæntəˈmɪmɪk/ 哑剧式的}} style. The loudest {{applause /əˈplɔːz/ 掌声}} came at the {{curtain call /ˈkɜːtn kɔːl/ 谢幕}}.",
