        "content": "{{Revenue /ˈrevənjuː/ 收入}} began to {{evaporate /ɪˈvæpəreɪt/ 消失}}; its {{evaporation /ɪˌvæpəˈreɪʃn/ 消失}} could {{vaporize /ˈveɪpəraɪz/ 使蒸发}} the {{budget /ˈbʌdʒɪt/ 预算}}. Printed titles might become {{extinct /ɪkˈstɪŋkt/ 绝迹}}, making their {{extinction /ɪkˈstɪŋkʃn/ 消亡}} official.",
