        "content": "They protected {{circulation /ˌsɜːkjəˈleɪʃn/ 发行量}}, {{distribution}}, and every {{publication}} while advertising {{sought}} {{advertising revenue /ˈædvətaɪzɪŋ ˈrevənjuː/ 广告收入}}.",
