        "content": "The {{catalogue /ˈkætəlɒɡ/ 目录}} offered a {{business magazine /ˈbɪznəs ˌmæɡəˈziːn/ 商业杂志}}, consumer magazine, literary magazine, science magazine, and news magazine; a {{journal /ˈdʒɜːnl/ 期刊}} carried a journal article , while an {{anthology /ænˈθɒlədʒi/ 选集}}, {{encyclopedia /ɪnˌsaɪkləˈpiːdiə/ 百科全书}}, and {{paperback /ˈpeɪpəbæk/ 平装书}} occupied one {{shelf /ʃelf/ 书架}}.",
