        "deckId": "deck-mty3z5jr-2x6mmx",
        "content": "An {{orientation meeting /ˌɔːriənˈteɪʃn ˈmiːtɪŋ/ 介绍会}} was meant to provide {{orientation /ˌɔːriənˈteɪʃn/ 方向指引}}, but its {{arrows /ˈærəʊz/ 箭头}} could {{disorient /dɪsˈɔːriənt/ 使迷失方向}} everyone. {{Entry // RuChang}} required {{access /ˈækses/ 通道}} through the entrance; the exit required an {{exit visa /ˈeksɪt ˈviːzə/ 出境签证}}, while {{emergency exits /ɪˈmɜːdʒənsi ˈeksɪts/ 紧急出口}} led to {{dessert /dɪˈzɜːt/ 甜点}}. Guests stepped {{forth // WaiChu}}, walked back and forth, and listed carrots, peas, and {{so forth /səʊ fɔːθ/ 等等}}. The {{aroma /əˈrəʊmə/ 香味}} could {{call forth /kɔːl fɔːθ/ 引起}} hunger; the manager would {{bring forth /brɪŋ fɔːθ/ 提出}} a {{proposal /prəˈpəʊzl/ 提案}} and {{set forth /set fɔːθ/ 阐明}} the rules.",
        "order": 26,
