        "content": "Each claimed {{relevant expertise /ˈreləvənt ˌekspɜːˈtiːz/ 相关的专业知识}}; none could {{operate /ˈɒpəreɪt/ 操作}} the coffee machine. The bank would {{accredit /əˈkredɪt/ 信任，认可}} the institute only after formal {{accreditation /əˌkredɪˈteɪʃn/ 资格鉴定}}. Its director expressed a belief in our {{credibility /ˌkredəˈbɪləti/ 可信性}}, called the proposal {{credible /ˈkredəbl/ 可信的}}, and described the {{bill /bɪl/ 账单}} as {{incredible /ɪnˈkredəbl/ 难以置信的}}.",
