        "content": "During the {{audit /ˈɔːdɪt/ 审计}}, the boss tried to {{conceal /kənˈsiːl/ 隐藏}} a {{cryptic /ˈkrɪptɪk/ 含义隐晦的}} {{invoice /ˈɪnvɔɪs/ 发票}}, {{dissemble /dɪˈsembl/ 掩饰}} his {{alarm /əˈlɑːm/ 惊慌}}, {{feign /feɪn/ 假装}} sleep, and hide behind a curtain. An {{unpaid /ˌʌnˈpeɪd/ 未付报酬的}} mathematician seemed to {{lurk /lɜːk/ 潜伏}} nearby and {{pretend /prɪˈtend/ 假装}} to {{admire /ədˈmaɪə/ 欣赏}} the {{décor /ˈdeɪkɔː/ 装饰}}.",
