        "content": "The director and {{assistant director /əˈsɪstənt dəˈrektə/ 副导演}} {{selected /sɪˈlektɪd/ 挑选}} the {{cast /kɑːst/ 演员阵容}} through {{chaotic /keɪˈɒtɪk/ 混乱的}} {{casting /ˈkɑːstɪŋ/ 演员挑选}}. The leading actor and actress {{refused /rɪˈfjuːzd/ 拒绝}} to play a role beside the {{supporting actors /səˈpɔːtɪŋ ˈæktəz/ 配角演员}}, so a {{stand-in /ˈstændɪn/ 替身演员}} and a {{bewildered /bɪˈwɪldəd/ 困惑的}} {{walk-on /ˈwɔːk ɒn/ 临时演员}} joined the film {{crew /kruː/ 摄制组}}. The crew gave the zombie a {{costume /ˈkɒstjuːm/ 服装}}, then placed it in the {{spotlight /ˈspɒtlaɪt/ 聚光灯}}.",
