        "content": "As far as {{goods /ɡʊdz/ 货物}} {{transport /ˈtrænspɔːt/ 运输}} is concerned, {{growth /ɡrəʊθ/ 增长}} is due to a large {{extent /ɪkˈstent/ 程度}} to changes in the European {{economy /ɪˈkɒnəmi/ 经济}} and its {{system of production /ˈsɪstəm əv prəˈdʌkʃn/ 生产体系}}. Our {{clerk /klɑːk/ 职员}}, however, was {{chiefly /ˈtʃiːfli/ 主要地}} {{concerned /kənˈsɜːnd/ 关注的}} with {{lunch /lʌntʃ/ 午餐}}.",
