        "deckId": "deck-mw0tcdvo-eiwl3n",
        "content": "The manager {{issued /ˈɪʃuːd/ 发布，下发}} an absolute, {{categorical /ˌkætəˈɡɒrɪkl/ 明确的}}, definite, positive, and unconditional {{denial /dɪˈnaɪəl/ 否认}}, {{solely /ˈsəʊlli/ 仅仅}} on his own {{authority /ɔːˈθɒrəti/ 权威}}. It was {{utterly /ˈʌtəli/ 完全地}}, absolutely, entirely, totally, and completely {{convincing /kənˈvɪnsɪŋ/ 令人信服的}}—until a complete {{crate /kreɪt/ 板条箱}} {{vanished /ˈvænɪʃt/ 消失}}.",
