        "content": "The clerk had {{barely /ˈbeəli/ 几乎不}}, {{indeed /ɪnˈdiːd/ 确实}} {{merely /ˈmɪəli/ 仅仅}}, counted it; the camera {{hardly /ˈhɑːdli/ 几乎不}}, or {{scarcely /ˈskeəsli/ 几乎不}}, recorded him. He missed the train {{clean /kliːn/ 完全地}}, and his {{estimate /ˈestɪmət/ 估算}} was {{dead wrong /ded rɒŋ/ 完全错误}}. A {{drastic /ˈdræstɪk/ 激烈的}}, almost violent, price rise made the bill {{exorbitant /ɪɡˈzɔːbɪtənt/ 过分的}}, excessive, and unreasonable.",
